<!doctype html>
<html lang="{{ request.locale.iso_code }}" data-theme="light">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#FCF6E6">
  <link rel="canonical" href="{{ canonical_url }}">
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="{{ 'favicon.png' | asset_url }}">

  {%- comment -%}
    Les pages du site sont écrites dans le thème (sections/main-page.liquid) :
    leur titre aussi, dans locales/*.json › page_titles, plutôt que de devoir
    saisir et traduire chaque titre dans l'admin.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- if template.name == 'page' -%}
    {%- capture key -%}{%- render 'page-key', page: page -%}{%- endcapture -%}
    {%- assign key = 'page_titles.' | append: key -%}
    {%- assign translated = key | t -%}
    {%- unless translated contains 'translation missing' or translated contains 'Translation missing' -%}{%- assign page_title = translated -%}{%- endunless -%}
  {%- endif -%}
  <title>{{ page_title }}{% if current_tags %} &ndash; {{ current_tags | join: ', ' }}{% endif %}{% unless page_title contains shop.name %} &ndash; {{ shop.name }}{% endunless %}</title>
  {% if page_description %}<meta name="description" content="{{ page_description | escape }}">{% endif %}

  {%- comment -%}
    Thème appliqué avant le premier rendu, sinon la page clignote en clair
    puis bascule en sombre. Repris tel quel de morgane_theme_boot_script().
  {%- endcomment -%}
  <script>
    (function(){
      try {
        var s = localStorage.getItem('morgane-theme');
        var d = window.matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme: dark)').matches;
        document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-theme', s || (d ? 'dark' : 'light'));
      } catch (e) {
        document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-theme', 'light');
      }
    })();
  </script>

  {%- comment -%}
    Polices auto-hébergées, sous-ensembles latin et latin-ext. Déclarées ici
    et non dans un fichier : le dossier `assets` de Shopify est à plat, les
    chemins relatifs de fonts.css n'y résolvent pas.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  <style>
    @font-face { font-family:'Caveat'; font-style:normal; font-weight:500; font-display:swap;
      src:url({{ 'caveat-latin.woff2' | asset_url }}) format('woff2');
      unicode-range:U+0000-00FF,U+0131,U+0152-0153,U+02BB-02BC,U+02C6,U+02DA,U+02DC,U+0304,U+0308,U+0329,U+2000-206F,U+20AC,U+2122,U+2191,U+2193,U+2212,U+2215,U+FEFF,U+FFFD; }
    @font-face { font-family:'Caveat'; font-style:normal; font-weight:500; font-display:swap;
      src:url({{ 'caveat-latin-ext.woff2' | asset_url }}) format('woff2');
      unicode-range:U+0100-02BA,U+02BD-02C5,U+02C7-02CC,U+02CE-02D7,U+02DD-02FF,U+0304,U+0308,U+0329,U+1D00-1DBF,U+1E00-1E9F,U+1EF2-1EFF,U+2020,U+20A0-20AB,U+20AD-20C0,U+2113,U+2C60-2C7F,U+A720-A7FF; }
    @font-face { font-family:'Caveat'; font-style:normal; font-weight:600; font-display:swap;
      src:url({{ 'caveat-latin.woff2' | asset_url }}) format('woff2');
      unicode-range:U+0000-00FF,U+0131,U+0152-0153,U+02BB-02BC,U+02C6,U+02DA,U+02DC,U+0304,U+0308,U+0329,U+2000-206F,U+20AC,U+2122,U+2191,U+2193,U+2212,U+2215,U+FEFF,U+FFFD; }
    @font-face { font-family:'Caveat'; font-style:normal; font-weight:600; font-display:swap;
      src:url({{ 'caveat-latin-ext.woff2' | asset_url }}) format('woff2');
      unicode-range:U+0100-02BA,U+02BD-02C5,U+02C7-02CC,U+02CE-02D7,U+02DD-02FF,U+0304,U+0308,U+0329,U+1D00-1DBF,U+1E00-1E9F,U+1EF2-1EFF,U+2020,U+20A0-20AB,U+20AD-20C0,U+2113,U+2C60-2C7F,U+A720-A7FF; }
    @font-face { font-family:'DM Sans'; font-style:normal; font-weight:400 700; font-display:swap;
      src:url({{ 'dm-sans-latin.woff2' | asset_url }}) format('woff2');
      unicode-range:U+0000-00FF,U+0131,U+0152-0153,U+02BB-02BC,U+02C6,U+02DA,U+02DC,U+0304,U+0308,U+0329,U+2000-206F,U+20AC,U+2122,U+2191,U+2193,U+2212,U+2215,U+FEFF,U+FFFD; }
    @font-face { font-family:'DM Sans'; font-style:normal; font-weight:400 700; font-display:swap;
      src:url({{ 'dm-sans-latin-ext.woff2' | asset_url }}) format('woff2');
      unicode-range:U+0100-02BA,U+02BD-02C5,U+02C7-02CC,U+02CE-02D7,U+02DD-02FF,U+0304,U+0308,U+0329,U+1D00-1DBF,U+1E00-1E9F,U+1EF2-1EFF,U+2020,U+20A0-20AB,U+20AD-20C0,U+2113,U+2C60-2C7F,U+A720-A7FF; }
    @font-face { font-family:'Fraunces'; font-style:normal; font-weight:300 600; font-display:swap;
      src:url({{ 'fraunces-latin.woff2' | asset_url }}) format('woff2');
      unicode-range:U+0000-00FF,U+0131,U+0152-0153,U+02BB-02BC,U+02C6,U+02DA,U+02DC,U+0304,U+0308,U+0329,U+2000-206F,U+20AC,U+2122,U+2191,U+2193,U+2212,U+2215,U+FEFF,U+FFFD; }
    @font-face { font-family:'Fraunces'; font-style:normal; font-weight:300 600; font-display:swap;
      src:url({{ 'fraunces-latin-ext.woff2' | asset_url }}) format('woff2');
      unicode-range:U+0100-02BA,U+02BD-02C5,U+02C7-02CC,U+02CE-02D7,U+02DD-02FF,U+0304,U+0308,U+0329,U+1D00-1DBF,U+1E00-1E9F,U+1EF2-1EFF,U+2020,U+20A0-20AB,U+20AD-20C0,U+2113,U+2C60-2C7F,U+A720-A7FF; }
  </style>

  <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ 'wp-blocks.css' | asset_url }}">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ 'base.css' | asset_url }}">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ 'app.css' | asset_url }}">

  {%- comment -%} Le masque du logo : chemin à plat, celui d'app.css ne résout pas ici. {%- endcomment -%}
  <style>
    .site-header__brand a {
      -webkit-mask: url({{ 'logo.webp' | asset_url }}) center / contain no-repeat;
              mask: url({{ 'logo.webp' | asset_url }}) center / contain no-repeat;
    }
  </style>

  {{ content_for_header }}
</head>

<body class="template-{{ template.name | handle }}">

  <a class="skip-link" href="#contenu">{{ 'general.skip' | t }}</a>

  {%- comment -%}
    `wp-site-blocks` n'est pas un vestige : c'est le conteneur flex qui tient
    le pied de page en bas des pages courtes (app.css § 1). On garde le nom
    pour ne pas toucher au CSS.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="wp-site-blocks">

    <header class="wp-block-template-part">{% section 'header' %}</header>

    <main class="wp-block-group" id="contenu">
      {{ content_for_layout }}
    </main>

    <footer class="wp-block-template-part">{% section 'footer' %}</footer>

  </div>

  <script src="{{ 'gsap.min.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>
  <script src="{{ 'ScrollTrigger.min.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>
  <script src="{{ 'app.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>
</body>
</html>
